---
description: Enforce production-app-standard P0/P1 engineering rules
alwaysApply: true
---

When writing or reviewing application code:

1. Follow `AGENTS.md`.
2. Use matching `docs/**` and `checklists/**` for the touched domain.
3. Treat P0 security/authz/backup/payment controls as blockers.
4. Prefer fixing production gaps over feature chrome.
5. Never commit secrets, bypass authz, or skip migrations.
